meta {
  name: Scratch Git Service - Run Store
  seq: 21
}

headers {
  Authorization: Bearer {{scratchGitAuthToken}}
}

docs {
  The Live Export run store on the scratch-git service itself (`:3100`), NOT the Scratch
  server. Internal server-to-scratch-git endpoints: one SQLite file per routine run at
  `{staging_dir}/le-<routineRunId>/run.db`, holding named collections of `{ key, meta, body }`
  entries — see scratch-git-2/docs/RUN_STORE.md.

  Requests target `{{scratchGitApiUrl}}` (Local: http://localhost:3100; Test/Production:
  http://127.0.0.1:3100 through `terraform/tools/connect_to_git_service.sh <env>`).
  This folder overrides the collection's `API-Token` header with
  `Authorization: Bearer {{scratchGitAuthToken}}` — set the secret `scratchGitAuthToken`
  variable to scratch-git's `SCRATCH_GIT_AUTH_TOKEN` (leave it empty locally, where the
  service is unauthenticated).

  Set `runStoreKey` to `le-<routineRunId>` (e.g. `le-rrn_AdVkcKA70W`). Collection names are
  URL path segments of `[A-Za-z0-9_.:-]` — percent-encode `:` (`source%3AProducts`). Run stores
  are disposable: Create/Clear wipes an existing store, Delete removes it. Every endpoint
  except create, delete and summary is a 404 when the store doesn't exist.
}
